[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1784752407","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1784752407","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1784752407,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5qYSkX","user":{"login":"LaumiH","id":37472890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDcyODkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37472890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH","html_url":"https://github.com/LaumiH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-30T08:59:59Z","updated_at":"2023-10-30T09:04:15Z","body":"In this pacp file you can see the association requests and responses from UPF 10.0.0.11, which previously failed. You can see that the SMF continues sending heartbeats to UPF 10.0.0.12, and tries to re-associate the failed UPF. However, although the association requests are correctly processed by the UPF, the responses are not processed by the SMF, and there is no re-association.\r\n[starved_association.pcap.zip](https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/files/13203021/starved_association.pcap.zip)\r\n\r\nHint: a re-association attempt starts at packet 2113, for example. I did not change the timeout and retry value for the association, meaning there are 3 attempts with a timeout of 3s each.\r\n\r\nI let this process run for 10 minutes and there was no re-association.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1784752407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1785127998","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1785127998","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1785127998,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5qZuQ-","user":{"login":"LaumiH","id":37472890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDcyODkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37472890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH","html_url":"https://github.com/LaumiH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-30T12:51:41Z","updated_at":"2023-10-30T12:52:09Z","body":"Here is a screenshot of the logs (I have adapted the log messages, so this is not the standard output):\r\n![starved_association_5](https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/assets/37472890/a8e73468-1ffb-4fb2-baeb-ec07648e6ebf)\r\n\r\nThis is also a better pcap file showing just the relevant association messages on the N4 interface. The heartbeat at that time is stopped completely on both UPFs, so the SMF really only sends the association setup messages. No UEs are connected.\r\nYou can see that the retry mechanism indeed seems to work, a retry is sent every 3 seconds. However, the SMF does not receive the responses from the transactions' `EventChannel`.\r\n[starved_association_5.pcap.zip](https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/files/13205236/starved_association_5.pcap.zip)\r\n\r\nTo me, it seems like the transaction channel is closed or read by some other transaction instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1785127998/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1786947510","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1786947510","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1786947510,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5qgqe2","user":{"login":"LaumiH","id":37472890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDcyODkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37472890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH","html_url":"https://github.com/LaumiH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-10-31T10:35:59Z","updated_at":"2023-10-31T10:35:59Z","body":"I think I just found the bug: It is [this operation](https://github.com/free5gc/pfcp/blob/main/pfcpUdp/udp.go#L115) that blocks indefinitely. There is no error thrown however, so the PFCP server receive goroutine just blocks indefinitely.\r\n\r\nI would suggest to fix this problem using a timer like this:\r\n```Golang\r\nselect {\r\ncase tx.EventChannel <- pfcp.ReceiveEvent{\r\n\tType:       pfcp.ReceiveEventTypeValidResponse,\r\n\tRemoteAddr: msg.RemoteAddr,\r\n\tRcvMsg:     pfcpMsg,\r\n}:\r\ncase <-time.After(2 * time.Second):\r\n\tlogger.PfcpLog.Errorf(\"Worker %d timed out on sending to EventChannel\", id)\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis allows the goroutine to continue if the channel is closed. Maybe the problem is that the channel is closed in the middle of writing to it, I cannot say for sure. But this fixes my problem.\r\n\r\nI am going to create a PR with this fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1786947510/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1788688439","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1788688439","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1788688439,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5qnTg3","user":{"login":"LaumiH","id":37472890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDcyODkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37472890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH","html_url":"https://github.com/LaumiH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-01T09:53:03Z","updated_at":"2023-11-01T09:53:03Z","body":"See https://github.com/free5gc/pfcp/pull/16 for a fix to my issue :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1788688439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1814066075","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1814066075","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1814066075,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5sIHOb","user":{"login":"tzuchiehhh","id":135809479,"node_id":"U_kgDOCBhJxw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135809479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh","html_url":"https://github.com/tzuchiehhh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-16T09:20:31Z","updated_at":"2023-11-16T09:20:31Z","body":"Hi @LaumiH, \r\n\r\nI am interested in this issue, but I have encountered some problems while attempting to reproduce the scenario. Are both UPFs designated as PSA-UPF, or is there one PSA-UPF and one I-UPF? Does each UPF connect to a separate SMF, or do both UPFs connect to a single SMF? \r\n\r\nThanks for your assistance","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1814066075/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1815256201","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1815256201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1815256201,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5sMpyJ","user":{"login":"LaumiH","id":37472890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDcyODkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37472890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH","html_url":"https://github.com/LaumiH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-16T20:22:01Z","updated_at":"2023-11-17T08:33:27Z","body":"Hi @tzuchiehhh,\r\n\r\nboth the UPFs are PSAs, I have no i-UPF in my setup. I have a single SMF.\r\n\r\nEssentially, I found that the heartbeat implementation altogether lacks accuracy and is influenced a lot by the session management process. I have a fix for this, introducing worker threads to the PFCP server of the SMF to handle incoming PFCP messages. Also, I noticed that the SMF and UPF do not use the same PFCP implementation, which is sth. I don't understand yet. Maybe this has historic reasons.\r\n\r\nI think the parallel processing in the PFCP server of the SMF mainly causes the issue. Maybe the code is not thread-safe.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1815256201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1836191977","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1836191977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1836191977,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5tchDp","user":{"login":"tim-ywliu","id":68043973,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDQzOTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68043973?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu","html_url":"https://github.com/tim-ywliu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tim-ywliu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-12-01T14:17:26Z","updated_at":"2023-12-01T14:17:26Z","body":"@LaumiH \r\n\r\n> Also, I noticed that the SMF and UPF do not use the same PFCP implementation, which is sth. I don't understand yet. Maybe this has historic reasons.\r\n\r\nYes, upf had been refactored. We're going to refactor smf as upf and replace pfcp with go-pfcp.\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1836191977/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1850705569","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1850705569","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1850705569,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5uT4ah","user":{"login":"tzuchiehhh","id":135809479,"node_id":"U_kgDOCBhJxw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135809479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh","html_url":"https://github.com/tzuchiehhh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tzuchiehhh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-12-11T19:03:13Z","updated_at":"2023-12-11T19:03:13Z","body":"Hi, @LaumiH,\r\nI configured the heartbeat interval to 10ms in smf config file and set NumOfResend=0, ResendRequestTimeOutPeriod =10 and ResendResponseTimeOutPeriod = 10 in pfcp transaction.go. However, repeated association failures didn't happen.  I've noticed that there is no \"new node\" message on the UPF. Is there anything I might be missing?\r\n\r\n![transaction](https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/assets/135809479/da4a12fa-e1c5-4b4d-acf8-03b5f78a7375)\r\n\r\n![smf](https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/assets/135809479/f474774f-99b6-491e-81f4-0e2e291cd733)\r\n\r\n![upf](https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/assets/135809479/c4c353b3-6573-4336-bdf4-adf0d0bc5384)\r\n\r\nThanks for your assistance","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1850705569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1933675937","html_url":"https://github.com/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502#issuecomment-1933675937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/502","id":1933675937,"node_id":"IC_kwDODiZOqs5zQY2h","user":{"login":"LaumiH","id":37472890,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NDcyODkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37472890?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH","html_url":"https://github.com/LaumiH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaumiH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-08T09:29:27Z","updated_at":"2024-02-08T09:29:27Z","body":"Hi,\r\n\r\nI investigated more into the problem. In fact, I did make changes to the heartbeat behavior previously (and forgot about them ...), because I noticed its inaccuracy. I am sending heartbeats in a separate thread, decoupled from receiving the actual reply from the UPF. \r\nThe way it is implemented currently, a new heartbeat is only sent after receiving a reply from the UPF, which causes the heartbeat interval to fluctuate above the configured interval, e.g. 12ms instead of 10ms.\r\n\r\nYou have no new node message in the UPF this was something I added for debugging purposes.\r\n\r\nIf you are currently refactoring the PFCP behavior of the SMF anyways, I might wait before issuing a PR with my changes/ proposal, so as not to have double work in the end :)\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nLaumiH","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/free5gc/free5gc/issues/comments/1933675937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]]